# 只让镜像拿到「源码 + 依赖清单」，其余一律不进构建上下文。
# 尤其是 photos/（原始素材，绝不能进镜像层）与本机的 node_modules。
# Only source and manifests reach the image. photos/ (original material) and the
# host's node_modules must never enter a layer.

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
photos
dist
spec
android
scripts
*.md
!src/server/*.md
